  "note": "Borough elections, 15 January 1934. Five aldermen and five councillors were returned unopposed; a threatened contest in Castle Ward was averted when Mr. J. A. Davidson withdrew. Mr. J. A. Davidson withdrew and Dr. R. M. Bowman was returned unopposed. Returned unopposed."
